      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Foreign aid is not a drain on our resources but an investment in the very global systems—such as disease control and climate stability—that protect all of us. By supporting international partners who lack funding, we enable them to absorb the shock of global crises before they impact our own communities. Ultimately, true philanthropy and civic duty are amplified when we extend our hand to the most vulnerable to ensure no one is left behind in the future we all share.",
